sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Client as Клиент
    participant GW as API Gateway
    participant B as booking-service
    participant I as inventory-service
    participant P as payment-service
    participant MQ as RabbitMQ
    Client->>GW: POST /api/v1/bookings + Idempotency-Key
    GW->>B: Создать заказ
    B->>I: POST /internal/v1/reservations
    I-->>B: reservationId, HELD
    B->>P: Создать платёж
    P-->>B: paymentUrl
    Note over Client,P: Провайдер отклоняет платёж
    P->>MQ: payment.failed (outbox)
    MQ-->>B: payment.failed
    B->>B: Проверка eventId, статус CANCELLED
    B->>I: DELETE /internal/v1/reservations/{id}
    I-->>B: 204 резерв освобождён
    B->>MQ: booking.cancelled
    Note over B,I: Компенсация: ReleaseReservation
    Note over B,Client: Клиент видит CANCELLED; повторная доставка события безопасна
